  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.14 Proposed action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.14 “Proposed action” means any proposed alteration, disturbance, or modification to land, waters, or structures that requires a state agency permit, approval, or other written authorization.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
